    {
      "page": 0,
      "role": "paragraph",
      "text": "The graphics state stack restores clipping, colour, and transformation together, which is why a stray q without Q corrupts a page. Text is positioned by two matrices, one for the line and one for the run, and every show operator advances the second of them. Word spacing applies only to the single byte code thirty two, which is why it silently does nothing inside a composite font.",
